OL,3,GNEWSASnake undergoes 'world-first'
OL,4,Ahuman cancer therapy
OL,5,
OL,6,FA snake named after the Hollywood star
OL,7,FJodie Foster has made a full recovery
OL,8,Fafter receiving cancer treatment
OL,9,Fnormally used in humans.
OL,11,FThe 4m (15ft) reticulated python, who
OL,12,Flives at Chester Zoo, was given
OL,13,Felectrochemotherapy after a cancerous
OL,14,Ftumour was discovered in its jawbone.
OL,16,FThe reptile is believed to be the first
OL,17,Fsnake in the world to receive this kind
OL,18,Fof treatment, according to the
OL,19,Fveterinary team at Chester Zoo.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
